  - q: "What is the minimum age for quad biking in Dubai?"
    a: "Six years old on a 70 to 90cc machine in our fenced kids area, twelve in the marked two-kilometre boundary area, and fourteen in the open desert and on the Yamaha Raptor 700cc. Double-seat quads in the open desert need a driver of sixteen or over. The riding area sets the age, not the engine on its own."
